# Rules Consistency Check

Before saving any `.cursor/rules/` or `.cursor/skills/` file (new or edited), re-read ALL `always-applied` rules and verify the new/edited content does not contradict any of them.

If a contradiction exists — fix it before saving. Do not create rules that a future agent session would interpret as conflicting with always-applied constraints.
